# An allowlist: the repo root holds venvs, node_modules and built docs that
# must not be sent to the daemon. (Used because the Dockerfile is named
# `Dockerfile`; BuildKit picks up `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` first.)
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!alembic.ini
!src
!examples/django_demo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
